{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01595","headline":"琴曲歌辞 风入松歌 · 僧皎然","name":"琴曲歌辞 风入松歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西岭松声落日秋，千枝万叶风飕飀。\n美人援琴弄成曲，写得松间声断续。\n声断续，清我魂，流波坏陵安足论。\n美人夜坐月明里，含少商兮照清徵。\n风何凄兮飘飉，搅寒松兮又夜起。\n夜未央，曲何长，金徽更促声泱泱。\n何人此时不得意，意苦弦悲闻客堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}